---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Who I am and why I'm starting this blog"
	pubDate={new Date('February 09 2026')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		Welcome! I'm glad you're here.
	</p>

	<p>
		I used to spend a lot of my time as a content creator. While I loved the process of creating and 
		connecting with people, I eventually felt the need to step back and reevaluate what I wanted to build.
	</p>

	<p>
		This site represents a fresh start. It's a space for me to "think out loud," document the things 
		I'm learning in real-time, and share perspectives that I find interesting. No algorithms to chase, 
		just a direct line from my thoughts to this page.
	</p>

	<p>
		Right now, I'm focusing on exploring new technologies and finding my voice in a more long-form, 
		intentional medium.
	</p>

	<p>
		Thanks for joining me on this new chapter. If you want to reach out or stay updated, feel free to 
		check out the links below!
	</p>
</Layout>
